# artifacts/ policy (decided 2026-07-11): version durable text evidence
# (receipts, gate results, manifests, summaries, golden test fixtures); never
# version build/dep trees or bulk regenerable run-output. See below.
# 1) Node/Vite build + deps for any poster/app under artifacts/ (100s of MB):
artifacts/**/node_modules/
artifacts/**/dist/
artifacts/**/.npm-cache/
artifacts/**/*.map
# 2) NeuroDyn campaign run-output tree (~640 MB, regenerable from scripts/research/);
#    keep only the top-level evidence/verify manifests as provenance:
artifacts/research/neurodyn/**
!artifacts/research/neurodyn/neurodyn_evidence_bundle_*.json
# EISA gate transient working dir (regenerated each gate run)
artifacts/**/.gate_tmp/
